@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

actor 学生 as S
participant "预约控制器" as C
participant "预约服务" as SV
participant "身份接口" as AUTH
participant "可预约时段" as SLOT
participant "预约仓储接口" as REPO

S -> C : 1 提交预约请求
C -> AUTH : 2 校验令牌
AUTH --> C : 3 返回用户信息
C -> SV : 4 提交(命令)
SV -> SLOT : 5 查询时段并校验冲突
SLOT --> SV : 6 可用
SV -> SV : 7 校验容量与开放状态
SV -> REPO : 8 开启事务并保存申请
REPO --> SV : 9 返回预约编号
SV --> C : 10 提交结果
C --> S : 11 返回待审核状态

note over SV : 任一步校验失败时回滚事务，\n不产生预约记录并返回失败原因
@enduml
